                "word": "galgenbrok",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "nl",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "514fdbc8-8c3e-4a49-8da4-cd3ec963ff29",
                        "entry_id": "1166b349-b076-395e-bea2-b8beac55ffba",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "galgenbrokken"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "718e35b7-74aa-37cf-b894-ef9bd4083e0d",
                        "entry_id": "1166b349-b076-395e-bea2-b8beac55ffba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "iemand die het verdient om aan de galg te hangen; een waardeloos of verdorven persoon"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "pejorative"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "08da0f97-610f-403a-b062-d249f2b30d89",
                                "sense_id": "718e35b7-74aa-37cf-b894-ef9bd4083e0d",
                                "text": "’Ben jij besuikerd!’, riep een vader altijd als zijn dochtertje iets ondeugends had gedaan. En besuikerd betekende gek. Radioprogramma De Taalstaat staat zaterdag geheel in het teken van dergelijke vergeetwoorden.........Scheldwoorden als galgenbrok en schobbejak. Of ja, nakketikker of niksnakker.”"
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0d085784-1d4a-35ba-95e8-368ccc612d0a",
                        "entry_id": "1166b349-b076-395e-bea2-b8beac55ffba",
                        "glosses": [
                            "deugniet, schavuit"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "in afgezwakte betekenis"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "36cf0f9a-57fc-402a-aa4a-81b71dac9b54",
                                "sense_id": "0d085784-1d4a-35ba-95e8-368ccc612d0a",
                                "text": "Jij galgenbrok, waar ben je?"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c0ad74d5-f410-470f-ab77-96910296f7d9",
                        "source_entry_id": "1166b349-b076-395e-bea2-b8beac55ffba",
                        "source_sense_id": "718e35b7-74aa-37cf-b894-ef9bd4083e0d",
                        "source_sense_description": "iemand die het verdient om aan de galg te hangen; een waardeloos of verdorven persoon",
                        "target_lang_word": "gallows-bird",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "gallows-bird",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "85fa619c-231d-3ef1-8889-9e0fd1dc7c9d",
                                        "entry_id": "15d0409c-203e-3a48-92c6-a2ec5a09c07f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Alternative form of gallows bird."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "alternative"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "117334a9-ebb2-410c-8196-a1fc70b916b3",
                                                "sense_id": "85fa619c-231d-3ef1-8889-9e0fd1dc7c9d",
                                                "text": "He had been seen to arrive by the way of the boulevard Gassendi and roam about the streets in the gloaming. A gallows-bird with a terrible face."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c585123-1525-4031-8bd5-3d0bf872b067",
                                                "sense_id": "85fa619c-231d-3ef1-8889-9e0fd1dc7c9d",
                                                "text": "\"And you would be a highwayman, would you, gallows-bird—\" began the Countess."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e3e77e7-c1d8-40fa-9514-4f5dc6291ac6",
                                                "sense_id": "85fa619c-231d-3ef1-8889-9e0fd1dc7c9d",
                                                "text": "Well, I see no reason why every gallows-bird in the district should wear out the King's gaol before his time; so you can wait until you're ready to hang, and I'll promise you'll have the same cell as the late dear departed."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b7d8edf1-1a82-4b10-a042-52416abb40fc",
                                                "sense_id": "85fa619c-231d-3ef1-8889-9e0fd1dc7c9d",
                                                "text": "Small wonder, then, that at this juncture my mind should be drawn to you, but be assured, sir, that I hold you to be more than a mere gallows-bird, more than my fellow following four years behind."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "e51def89-d5ac-4f7b-8b6c-5fcc616ec916",
                        "source_entry_id": "1166b349-b076-395e-bea2-b8beac55ffba",
                        "source_sense_id": "718e35b7-74aa-37cf-b894-ef9bd4083e0d",
                        "source_sense_description": "iemand die het verdient om aan de galg te hangen; een waardeloos of verdorven persoon",
                        "target_lang_word": "scoundrel",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "scoundrel",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e64e2e3b-3d36-3402-9722-deb59bbe2eab",
                                        "entry_id": "34d9ae45-77f7-33a0-8fae-f45e53bc777c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A mean, worthless fellow; a rascal; a villain; a person without honor or virtue."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bb77ead4-1e1b-4373-948b-f21dc5a29d40",
                                                "sense_id": "e64e2e3b-3d36-3402-9722-deb59bbe2eab",
                                                "text": "Go! if your ancient but ignoble blood / Has crept thro' Scoundrels ever ſince the Flood."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
